        "code": {
          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        },
        "content": "### Availability cube — current face\n\nOne cell per `(reservable_id, target_date)`, read straight from **`availability_cell`** — the cube's *now* face, upserted on every poll. `last_observed_at` bumps every tick; `status` / `last_changed_at` advance only on an edge (status change). The append-only transition history lives in `availability_snapshot`; drill into it from the **[Watch drill-down](/d/reservable-watch-drill/reservable-watch-drill)**.\n\nRows are reservables (site), columns are `target_date`, color is the current `status`. `past` = the date has elapsed and the cube stopped recording.",
